# Custom Suricata rules (examples)
alert dns any any -> any any (msg:"DNS tunneling candidate (long query)"; dns.query; isdataat:50,relative; sid:1000001; rev:1;)
alert tcp any any -> any any (msg:"Possible port scan (SYN)"; flags:S; sid:1000002; rev:1;)
alert smb any any -> any any (msg:"SMB lateral movement (PsExec-like) candidate"; content:"|5c 5c|"; sid:1000003; rev:1;)
